  "contracts": [
    "Periodic counters encode progress modulo the source period; asynchronous activation animations may display the period even after progress advances. Explicit history remains authoritative.",
    "IronClub uses cumulative CardsPlayed internally and displays modulo four; runtime history is required to retain the cumulative actor feature.",
    "Metronome display saturates at seven while source and engine OrbsChanneled continue increasing; the trigger occurs only at exactly seven.",
    "PaelsLegion source Cooldown can decrement below zero; engine readiness saturates at zero.",
    "One-shot combat/turn activation flags come from a finite bridge primitive allowlist; generic status does not prove whether a hook ran.",
    "UnsettlingLamp remembers a triggering card even when a debuff attempt was blocked.",
    "WongosMysteryTicket GaveRelic history maps to its used-up flag and initialized lifecycle, preventing a repeated payout during live previews.",
    "No persistent RNG, hidden selections, or validation oracle is accepted by the relic projection."
  ],
